<title>USA: Maxxim sees Q4 charge from acquisition.</title>
<headline>Maxxim sees Q4 charge from acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SUGAR LAND, Texas 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxxim Medical Inc said Tuesday it may see a one-time charge in the fourth quarter from its acquisition of Sterile Concepts, and that the acquisition could affect earnings in the fourth quarter and into fiscal 1997.</p>
</text>
